Secretarybird contains no code or assets from Razer Inc.

crates/secbird-core/devices.json restates hardware facts (USB product ids, names,
device types, DPI limits, lighting zones, key-grid sizes, lighting command set)
documented by the OpenRazer project (https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer,
GPL-2.0), checkout 477f4d6 from 2026-10-05. The facts were extracted with
tools/restate_openrazer.py; no OpenRazer code is included or executed.

The Kiyo Pro USB identity, extension-unit GUID and control payload facts are
restated from https://github.com/soyersoyer/kiyoproctrls (MIT). Its Python source
is not included or executed; the Rust implementation independently encodes the
documented device protocol.

Razer, Synapse, Chroma and product names are trademarks of Razer Inc. Secretarybird
is an independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Razer.
